{"task_id": "Mbpp/75", "solution": "def find_tuples(list_of_tuples, k):\n    \"\"\"Return a new list of tuples from list_of_tuples where every element is divisible by k.\n\n    Raises ValueError if k is 0.\n    \"\"\"\n    if k == 0:\n        raise ValueError(\"k must not be zero\")\n\n    result = []\n    for t in list_of_tuples:\n        if all(element % k == 0 for element in t):\n            result.append(t)\n    return result"}
