{"task_id": "Mbpp/172", "solution": "SUBSTRING_PATTERN: str = \"std\"\n\ndef count_occurance(input: str) -> int:\n    \"\"\"\n    Counts non-overlapping occurrences of the global SUBSTRING_PATTERN in the input string.\n    The search advances by the length of the pattern after each match.\n    \"\"\"\n    count = 0\n    start_index = 0\n    while True:\n        index = input.find(SUBSTRING_PATTERN, start_index)\n        if index == -1:\n            break\n        count += 1\n        start_index = index + len(SUBSTRING_PATTERN)\n    return count"}
