{"task_id": "Mbpp/278", "solution": "from .validator import Validator\nfrom .domain_models import TupleInput, Result\n\ndef count_first_elements(input_tuple: tuple) -> int:\n    \"\"\"Public API (FR1): Accept a single argument (tuple) and return int per SRS.\n    Raises TypeError if input is not a tuple.\n    \"\"\"\n    Validator.ensure_is_tuple(input_tuple)\n    \n    tuple_input = TupleInput(input_tuple)\n    \n    count = 0\n    for element in tuple_input.elements:\n        if Validator.is_tuple_element(element):\n            result = Result(count=count)\n            return result.count\n        count += 1\n            \n    # If the loop completes, no top-level tuple element was found.\n    # The count will represent the total number of elements.\n    result = Result(count=count)\n    return result.count"}
