{"task_id": "Mbpp/397", "solution": "from typing import Union\n\ndef validate_inputs(a: Union[int, float], b: Union[int, float], c: Union[int, float]) -> None:\n    \"\"\"Raise TypeError if any input is not int or float.\"\"\"\n    if not isinstance(a, (int, float)) or \\\n       not isinstance(b, (int, float)) or \\\n       not isinstance(c, (int, float)):\n        raise TypeError(\"All three inputs must be int or float\")\n\ndef median_numbers(a: Union[int, float], b: Union[int, float], c: Union[int, float]) -> float:\n    \"\"\"Validate inputs, compute median in O(1) time/space, and return as float.\"\"\"\n    validate_inputs(a, b, c)\n    median_val = (a + b + c) - min(a, b, c) - max(a, b, c)\n    return float(median_val)"}
