{"task_id": "Mbpp/626", "solution": "```python\ndef triangle_area(radius):\n    \"\"\"\n    Calculates the area of the largest triangle that can be inscribed in a semicircle.\n    Returns None if the radius is negative, otherwise returns radius * radius.\n    \"\"\"\n    if not isinstance(radius, (int, float)):\n        raise TypeError(\"Radius must be a numeric value (int or float).\")\n    if radius < 0:\n        return None\n    return radius * radius\n```"}
