{"task_id": "Mbpp/786", "solution": "def right_insertion(sequence, value) -> int:\n    \"\"\"\n    Locate the right insertion point for a specified value in a sorted sequence.\n    This function delegates to an internal binary search helper.\n    \"\"\"\n    return _right_insertion_binary_search(sequence, value)\n\ndef _right_insertion_binary_search(sequence, value) -> int:\n    \"\"\"\n    Internal helper implementing binary search to find the rightmost insertion point,\n    equivalent to bisect_right, ensuring O(log n) behavior.\n    \"\"\"\n    low = 0\n    high = len(sequence)\n\n    while low < high:\n        mid = (low + high) // 2\n        if sequence[mid] <= value:\n            low = mid + 1\n        else:\n            high = mid\n    return low"}
