{"task_id": "Mbpp/809", "solution": "def check_smaller(tuple_a, tuple_b) -> bool:\n    \"\"\"\n    Checks if each element of the second tuple is strictly smaller than its corresponding element in the first tuple.\n    Assumes tuples are of equal length.\n    \"\"\"\n    for i in range(len(tuple_a)):\n        if not (tuple_b[i] < tuple_a[i]):\n            return False\n    return True"}
